Fix the labels of parcellations with regions lost when resampling or warping to the target image, which shifted the labels of the following regions; the lost regions are kept (without data) and a warning lists them. The parcel markers are computed on the regions with data and give ``NaN`` for the lost ones (and :class:`.RSSETSMarker` only uses the edges with data) by `Fede Raimondo`_
